i. An autonomous system has 6 routers (A-F) connected by links with time costs (A-C 2, C-F 18, A-D 10, C-D 1, D-F 6, B-D 2, D-E 11, E-F 2, B-E 1). The distance vector algorithm is used. 1. Write the initial distance table of Router C. [2] 2. Find the shortest path from node C to all others. [4]
